teach_text = "Remember, shapeshifters tell the truth now. If someone says they are not a shapeshifter, it has to be true."
bottom_out_text = "A2 says they are not a shapeshifter. If they were one, it would be a lie, and shapeshifters tell the truth, so they are not a shapeshifter. This means there is a shapeshifting oraclem who tells the truth, and the other two lie. B1 says something true, so they must be a shapeshifter. We can check that if that is the case, the other ones do lie."

